---
// Keep the labels in HTML so the illustration remains readable at phone widths.
---
<figure class="engine-illustration" aria-label="Crossfield resolves semantic definitions and validates queries through hooks inside DuckDB">
  <div class="query-entry">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m14 13-7 7 7 7m12-14 7 7-7 7m-4-17-4 20"/></svg>
    <div><strong>People, applications and AI agents</strong><span>SQL using named business metrics</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 28"><path d="M12 0v25m-5-5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></div>
  <div class="engine-shell">
    <div class="engine-heading">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="7" y="7" width="14" height="14" rx="3"/><rect x="11" y="11" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M11 3v4m6-4v4m-6 14v4m6-4v4M3 11h4m-4 6h4m14-6h4m-4 6h4"/></svg>
      <strong>Inside your DuckDB connection</strong>
    </div>
    <div class="model-input">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 54 56" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect class="paper-back" x="5" y="9" width="35" height="43" rx="3"/><rect class="paper-middle" x="10" y="5" width="35" height="43" rx="3"/><rect class="paper-front" x="15" y="1" width="35" height="43" rx="3"/><path d="M23 12h18M23 19h18M23 26h12M23 33h8"/><circle cx="42" cy="35" r="4"/></svg>
      <div><strong>Attached semantic model</strong><span>Definitions · relationships · approved operations</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="model-feed" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="crossfield-stage">
      <div class="crossfield-brand"><img src="/crossfield/crossfield-mark.svg" alt="" width="42" height="42" /><div><strong>Crossfield</strong><span>Resolve definitions · validate · compile</span></div></div>
      <svg class="stage-traces" viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M120 18H70L50 38H0M120 42H82L64 60H20M120 66H92L74 84H40"/><circle cx="50" cy="38" r="3"/><circle cx="64" cy="60" r="3"/><circle cx="74" cy="84" r="3"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="binding-link">
      <span class="validation-line" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span>
      <span>Validation continues during binding</span>
    </div>
    <div class="duckdb-stage">
      <div class="duckdb-title"><strong>DuckDB</strong><span>Native query execution</span></div>
      <ol class="execution-path" aria-label="DuckDB query processing">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 4 4 10-10"/></svg><span>Bind &amp; validate</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"/><circle cx="9" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="8" cy="18" r="2"/></svg><span>Optimize</span></li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m8 5 10 7-10 7Z"/></svg><span>Execute</span></li>
      </ol>
      <div class="data-input"><svg viewBox="0 0 26 28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="13" cy="6" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M4 6v16c0 4 18 4 18 0V6M4 14c0 4 18 4 18 0"/></svg><span>Your tables and attached sources</span><svg class="data-arrow" viewBox="0 0 36 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2 20h24V4m-5 5 5-5 5 5"/></svg></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 28"><path d="M12 0v25m-5-5 5 5 5-5"/></svg></div>
  <div class="query-result"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 28" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="2" y="2" width="28" height="24" rx="3"/><path d="M2 10h28M2 18h28M13 10v16"/></svg><span>Results through the same SQL connection</span></div>
  <figcaption>Crossfield’s rules run inside the query lifecycle. Invalid semantic requests raise an error; local-table queries need no separate semantic query service.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .engine-illustration { margin:0; min-width:0; color:var(--color-soil-900); font-family:var(--font-sans); }
  svg { display:block; fill:none; stroke:currentColor; stroke-width:1.5; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; flex-shrink:0; }
  .query-entry { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.75rem; padding-inline:.5rem; }
  .query-entry > svg { width:36px; height:36px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .query-entry strong { display:block; font-size:.875rem; line-height:1.6; font-weight:600; }
  .query-entry span { display:block; margin-top:.15rem; font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.6; color:var(--color-soil-700); }
  .flow-line { display:flex; justify-content:center; height:28px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .flow-line svg { width:24px; height:28px; }
  .engine-shell { position:relative; isolation:isolate; border:1px solid #b3baa5; border-radius:1rem; padding:1.25rem; background:#fffdf7; box-shadow:0 3px 0 #e3dfd0,0 8px 0 -2px #f0ecdf,0 9px 0 -2px #c8c2af,0 16px 30px -20px #51472a55; }
  .engine-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; padding-bottom:1rem; margin-bottom:1rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-soil-300); }
  .engine-heading svg { width:27px; height:27px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .engine-heading strong { font-size:.8125rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.5; }
  .model-input { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:1rem; padding:.25rem .75rem 0; }
  .model-input > svg { width:45px; height:48px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .paper-back { fill:#e4e8d9; stroke:#acb79a; }
  .paper-middle { fill:#f6edda; stroke:#c9b985; }
  .paper-front { fill:#fffdf7; }
  .model-input circle { fill:#d7b65f; stroke:var(--color-sun-700); }
  .model-input strong { display:block; font-size:.875rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.5; }
  .model-input span { display:block; margin-top:.3rem; font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--color-soil-700); }
  .model-feed { display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:7px; height:24px; }
  .model-feed span { width:1px; background:#bcc5aa; }
  .model-feed span:nth-child(2) { background:var(--color-field-700); }
  .crossfield-stage { position:relative; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #87976f; border-left:4px solid var(--color-field-700); border-radius:.5rem; background:#edf1e4; padding:1.1rem; }
  .crossfield-brand { position:relative; z-index:1; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.85rem; }
  .crossfield-brand img { flex-shrink:0; width:38px; height:38px; }
  .crossfield-brand strong { display:block; font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.65rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-.02em; }
  .crossfield-brand span { display:block; margin-top:.4rem; font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.65; color:var(--color-soil-700); }
  .stage-traces { position:absolute; width:120px; height:100%; right:0; top:0; color:#7a8e60; opacity:.18; }
  .stage-traces circle { fill:#edf1e4; }
  .binding-link { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.65rem; min-height:48px; padding-left:1.4rem; }
  .binding-link > span:last-child { color:var(--color-field-700); font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .validation-line { position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-around; align-items:center; width:1px; height:48px; margin-inline:6px; background:var(--color-field-700); }
  .validation-line i { display:block; width:7px; height:7px; border:1px solid var(--color-field-700); background:#fffdf7; border-radius:50%; }
  .duckdb-stage { border:1px solid var(--color-soil-300); border-radius:.5rem; overflow:hidden; }
  .duckdb-title { display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.35rem .75rem; padding:.9rem 1rem .8rem; }
  .duckdb-title strong { font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:1.35rem; font-weight:600; line-height:1.2; }
  .duckdb-title > span { color:var(--color-soil-700); font-size:.75rem; }
  .execution-path { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); list-style:none; padding:0 .75rem .9rem; margin:0; gap:.6rem; }
  .execution-path li { position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:start; gap:.5rem; padding:.65rem .1rem; background:#f4f1e8; border-radius:.3rem; text-align:center; }
  .execution-path li + li::before { content:''; position:absolute; width:.6rem; height:1px; background:#b9b39e; top:50%; left:-.6rem; }
  .execution-path svg { width:21px; height:21px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .execution-path li:first-child { background:#edf1e4; }
  .execution-path li:last-child svg { fill:#f3e3b8; stroke:var(--color-sun-700); }
  .execution-path span { font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.5; }
  .data-input { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.6rem; border-top:1px solid var(--color-soil-300); padding:.65rem .85rem; background:#faf7ef; }
  .data-input > svg { width:23px; height:25px; color:var(--color-soil-700); }
  .data-input > span { font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.5; color:var(--color-soil-700); }
  .data-input .data-arrow { margin-left:auto; width:30px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .query-result { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:.75rem; padding:.85rem 1rem; border:1px solid #a6b292; border-radius:.5rem; background:#edf1e4; }
  .query-result svg { width:30px; height:27px; color:var(--color-field-700); }
  .query-result span { font-size:.8125rem; line-height:1.6; font-weight:500; }
  figcaption { margin-top:1rem; color:var(--color-soil-700); font-size:.75rem; line-height:1.75; }
  @media(max-width:450px) {
    .engine-shell { padding:.85rem; }
    .model-input { padding-inline:.2rem; gap:.65rem; }
    .model-input > svg { width:38px; }
    .crossfield-stage { padding:.85rem .65rem; }
    .crossfield-brand { gap:.65rem; }
    .crossfield-brand img { width:32px; height:32px; }
    .crossfield-brand strong { font-size:1.5rem; }
    .execution-path { padding-inline:.5rem; gap:.4rem; }
    .execution-path li + li::before { width:.4rem; left:-.4rem; }
  }
</style>
